"P3402375788" "Before you is the portal to Dark Astoria, a forsaken place where the dark god Mot threatens our very existence.  It is not adviseable to enter this portal unless you have reached the pinnacle of your powers as a hero and have begun on your path as an Incarnate.<br><br>If you feel you are ready but are uncertain on how to proceed, look for <Color Gold>Captain Nolan</color>, either here on Peregrine Island or among your contacts.<br><br>See my report for more information.  It should give you an idea what to expect:<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=PaleGoldenRod>RECONNAISSANCE REPORT</font></face></span><scale 1.5><span align=center><color red>*** Approved Use Only ***</color></scale></span><br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>History:</scale></color><br>The fog that has gripped Dark Astoria for years has receded, revealing a place filled with evil.  Mot’s influence is nearly complete, but it is not just his followers that roam these streets threatening the unfortunate souls that have found themselves trapped here.<br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>Hostiles Strength:</scale></color><br>Levels 50 through 54<br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>Suggested Squad Parameters:</scale></color><br>1-person to 3-person teams. 1-person to 5-person teams in Moth Cemetery<br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>Neighborhoods:</scale></color><br><br><color orange><b>- Romero Heights</color></b><br>The Bulwark can be found here, offering protection.  <color Red>Level Range: 50</color><br><br><color orange><b>- Barca Plaza</color></b><br>Beware of the Tsoo that guard this neighborhood.  <color Gold>Scintillating Prism</color> can be found here, offering protection. <color Red>Level Range: 50 to 51</color><br><br><color orange><b>- Toffet Terrace</color></b><br>Watch out for the Knives of Vengeance that prowl these streets.  The protected area known as <color gold>The Rose Lamp</color> can be found here. <color Red>Level Range: 51 to 52</color><br><br><color orange><b>- Raimi Arcade</color></b><br>The Circle of Thorns control this neighborhood.  While here, seek out <color gold>Fading Nimbus</color> or <color gold>Flicker</color> for sanctuary. <color Red>Level Range: 52 to 53</color><br><br><color orange><b>- Dido’s View</color></b><br>Talons of Vengeance threaten all who enter here. <color gold>Illuminous</color> offers protection in this neighborhood. <color Red>Level Range: 53 to 54</color><br><br><color orange><b>- Moth Cemetery</color></b><br>Banished Pantheon maintain unwavering control over the Cemetery. It is here that Mot’s sway is absolute. There is no protection to be found amongst the desecrated monuments so be cautious. Enemies here are more numerous than anywhere else. <color Red>Level Range: 54</color><br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>Identified Hostiles:</color></scale><br>- Banished Pantheon<br>- Circle of Thorns<br>- Tsoo<br>- Talons of Vengeance<br>- Knives of Vengeance<br>- Knives of Artemis<br><br><color YellowGreen><scale 1.1>Amenities:</color></scale><br>- St. Elegius Hospital<br><br>"
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_DarkAstoria_Info :

